---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="SIRYUS: independent creatives, art and tech, and a platform built for makers."
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="marketing-lede">
    We are misfits in the best sense: thinkers and doers, human and more than human. A collaboration between art and tech.
  </p>
  <img
    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
    alt="Creative team in a studio"
    width="1200"
    height="675"
    loading="lazy"
    style="width: 100%; max-height: 380px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(245,249,233,0.08);"
  />
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    Siryus Hub brings structure to creative work: projects, collaboration, and room to grow. SIRYUS A.M focuses on artist management and creative production where it matters.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/contact">Contact us</a> to talk about your goals.</p>
</BaseLayout>
